  "solution": {
    "text": "<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/ZM6sWNxcXPEqQvB8_byL2CiWCn7MvniGotvUdZThfPs.original.fullsize.png\"><br><br />Required area $A=\\int_{1-e}^0 y d x=\\int_{1-e}^0 \\log _e(x+e) d x$<br />put $x+e=t \\Rightarrow d x=d t$ also when $x=1-e, t=$ 1 and when $x=0, t=e$<br />$\\therefore A=\\int_1^e \\log _e t d t=\\left[t \\log _e t-t\\right]_1^e$<br />$e-e-0+1=1$",
